#: data/io.github.wuzi.RemindMe.metainfo.xml:9
msgid ""
"Remind Me is a focused reminder app for quick one-time notes. Write a "
"sentence with an optional English schedule such as “@tomorrow 9am”, and "
"receive an actionable desktop notification when it is due."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.wuzi.RemindMe.metainfo.xml:14
msgid ""
"Reminders stay on your device. Complete or snooze them from the "
"notification, review upcoming reminders by day, and keep a local history of "
"completed items."
msgstr ""

